WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
A user asks a question. The Kimi agent streams an answer with a calculator tool call.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
A consequential send_message action pauses the run and asks the operator for approval.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.000
The operator approves. The agent then stores a cloud preference with a stable memory key.

00:34.000 --> 00:44.800
In a new conversation within the same browser session, the agent recalls the complete stored fact.
